{title: Pyar Kiya To Nibhana}
{artist: Armaan Malik}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Kehta hai pal pal tumse
[G],        Ho ke dil yeh deewana
[G],        Ek pal bhi jaan-e-jaana
[F] [Am],        Mujhse door nahi jaana
[G],        Pyar kiya toh nibhana
[Am],        Pyar kiya toh nibhana
[Am],        Aankhon mein meri
[Am] [G],        Tera hi chehra dhadakta rahein
[Am],        Haan tu jo na mile
[Am] [F] [Am],        Seene mein dil yeh tadapta rahein
[Am] [G],        Tu mujhe na satana
[F] [Am],        Mera dil na dukhana
Main jahan rahun,        Tere hi paas wo jagah hai kahi
Matlab jeene ka,        Tere hi saanson mein chupa hai kahi
Main tere paas aaya sara chodke zamana,        Pyar kiya toh nibhana
Pyar kiya toh nibhana
